# Halpa's whistles in Thunder Bluff.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, Prairie Dog; the new ground
# squirrels); Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse prices: 50s each;
# every pet item teaches its companion when used).

step Halpa
  tip Halpa sells three whistles in Thunder Bluff (50s each, 1g 50s for all three); the two ground squirrels are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8401                         -- Halpa
  buy 10394 npc 8401 optional         -- Prairie Dog Whistle, 50s
  buy 280794 "Brown Ground Squirrel Whistle" npc 8401 optional -- 50s
  buy 280795 "Red Ground Squirrel Whistle" npc 8401 optional -- 50s
